 planet which is something  that no malian wants to happen by  combining their forces it would make  achieving those goals at least a bit  more plausible and this potential  alliance should be explored in more  detail next week  anyway people that was my breakdown for  episode 23 of attack on titan season 4  and if it helped you to understand the  episode in any way then i'd appreciate  if you dropped a like and let me know  your thoughts in the comments down below  also don't forget to check out this  special link in the description to  download dragon city and get your free  rewards  thanks for watching the video as always  and until the next one peace out

